      {
        "id": 202819,
        "name": "Paul",
        "username": "Paul",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-09-15T16:14:16.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>@godzilla999666 I am not currently comfortable giving firm predictions for Prime War, certainly not firm enough to base promises of Christmas presents. We are working on Prime War, and will continue to do so until it is complete and we are happy with it, but it will not be our exclusive focus. If that is something that makes you or anyone else uncomfortable, I am more than happy to issue you or anyone else a full refund on your preorder!</p>",
